ual involved.\nThen, select the option that best reflects their perspective or emotional response.\n\n# Output\n\nProvide only one single correct answer to this question.  Do not provide any additional information or explanations. The response should be in the following JSON format:\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nAlice had been working for a long time to afford the car of her dreams. After a lot of saving up, she was able to buy it today. Meanwhile, her brother Bill was going through financial struggles and had to sell his car a few weeks ago. Alice decided to take Bill for a ride in her new car that evening.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Alice ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Excitement\nB) Sentimental\nC) Guilt\nD) Disapproval\nE) Embarrassment\nF) Gratitude\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Alice feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She finally saved enough money to go on a luxurious vacation\nB) She managed to buy the car she had always dreamed of\nC) She managed to help her brother, Bill, out of financial struggles\nD) She got to buy a dream car for herself and her brother","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012431651676429883,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e916d6006945d280b5a3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369814915,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"l